  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Happy Birthday Liora!


    I can''t believe it is already the day my
    little chick will start flapping her wings and soar out of the nest.


    I
    am a little busy watching this potion boil, so I could not send you off. But
    here is a book that I used when I was a fledging. All important information is
    in the purple tabs.


    As you learn more spells, this magical tome will update
    and allow you to utilize your new magic. Isn''t this such an amazing gift?


    Check
    out your spells using the pink tab.

'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
